## Purpose

This policy establishes MedSync Health's approach to creating, protecting, and managing intellectual property assets. It ensures employees understand their obligations and the company's rights regarding IP.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All employees (full-time and part-time)
- Contractors and consultants
- Interns and temporary workers
- Board members and advisors

