### Open Source Policy

| License Type | Approval |
|--------------|----------|
| Permissive (MIT, BSD) | Pre-approved |
| Weak Copyleft (LGPL) | Review required |
| Strong Copyleft (GPL) | Legal approval |
| AGPL | Generally prohibited |

### Due Diligence

Before using third-party IP:
- Verify license terms
- Assess compatibility
- Document usage
- Get Legal approval if needed

