## Enforcement

### Infringement Response

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Identify infringement |
| 2 | Document evidence |
| 3 | Legal assessment |
| 4 | Cease and desist |
| 5 | Litigation (if needed) |

### Reporting Infringement

If you become aware of infringement:
- Report to Legal immediately
- Do not contact infringer
- Preserve evidence
- Maintain confidentiality

### Defense Against Claims

If MedSync is accused:
- Notify Legal immediately
- Preserve all relevant documents
- Do not admit liability
- Cooperate with investigation

